  "details": "# Issue:\n\nNow with Animated Emojis being a thing there a 3 different options when wanting to create an Emoji. 1 Frame, 4 Frames and 16 Frames.\n\nThis naming scheme is in my opinion a bit weird, as \"1 Frame\" is basically just a picture / photo while the other 2 are animated.\n\n# Suggestion:  \n\nRename \"1 Frame\" to Photo, as it better communicates what it is actually doing. It would also make it easier to differentiate between the animated and none animated ones.\n\n# Attachments:  \n\nHere is a screenshot showcasing the issue:",
